    "整个 App 的界面语言。切换后 App 会自动重新打开。建议回答跟着对话的语言走，不受这里影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The language of the whole app. The app reopens after you change it. Suggested answers follow the language of the conversation, not this setting."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理分三步：校对转写（结合资料里的专有名词纠正识别错误）→ 按模板整理（每条带原话的时间点）→ 核对（去掉没有原话依据的条目，相对日期换成具体日期，不确定的标“待确认”）。不重新识别声音，也不保存录音。整理在后台进行，失败时保留转写，可以重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Three steps: proofread the transcript (fix recognition errors using names and terms from your materials) → organize by template (every item cites when it was said) → check (drop items nothing in the transcript supports, turn relative dates into dates, mark unclear ones “to confirm”). Audio is not recognized again and never saved. It runs in the background; if it fails, the transcript is kept and you can retry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
