    "支持 PDF（含扫描件 OCR）、Word、PowerPoint、Excel、Markdown、TXT、RTF、HTML 与图片。可以一次拖入多个文件甚至整个文件夹：系统会把它们转成结构化 Markdown、在后台静默归档，并按内容自动归类。回答时只把与问题相关的片段交给模型，并标注来源。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supports PDF (including OCR for scans), Word, PowerPoint, Excel, Markdown, TXT, RTF, HTML, and images. Drop in multiple files or a folder to convert and archive them in the background. Materials are categorized automatically; answers only receive relevant excerpts with their sources."
