      }
    },
    "怎样从资料中找答案": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How to find answers in materials"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关键词查找": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keyword search"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "语义增强查找（可选）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Semantic search (optional)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按问题里的关键词挑选片段，准备快、占用少；问法和原文不同，或答案跨多个段落时，可能漏掉相关内容。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Selects excerpts by keywords. Fast and lightweight, but may miss paraphrases or answers spread across passages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "增加按含义查找，能帮助匹配同义问法。需下载模型、先建立索引，额外占用存储和内存；也可能漏检，仍保留关键词作为兜底。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adds meaning-based matching for paraphrases. Requires a model and index, storage and memory; it can still miss results, so keyword search remains available."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认只向回答服务发送相关资料片段；全量发送会增加等待和用量。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only relevant excerpts are sent to the answer service by default; sending all materials increases latency and usage."
          }
