    "两种方式都会挑选相关片段放进回答上下文，不会默认发送全部资料。全量发送会增加等待和用量，还可能超过模型的上下文上限；关闭向量检索不等于全文已经被读取。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both methods select relevant excerpts for the answer context instead of sending every document by default. Sending everything increases latency and usage and may exceed the model context limit. Disabling semantic retrieval does not mean every document has been read in full."
          }
        }
      }
    },
