      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bind and reopen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会在本机生成签名证书（保存在 Application Support/InterviewHacker/Signing），重新签名后重启应用。重启后请再允许一次录屏与麦克风，以后更新不再需要。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A local signing certificate will be created in Application Support/InterviewHacker/Signing. The app will be re-signed and reopened. Allow screen recording and microphone access once more after reopening; future updates will keep those permissions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
