    "未检测到 Codex：安装 ChatGPT / Codex 桌面客户端，或在终端运行 `npm i -g @openai/codex`，然后 `codex login` 用 ChatGPT 账号登录，再点右侧刷新。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex was not found. Install the ChatGPT or Codex desktop app, or run `npm i -g @openai/codex` and then `codex login` in Terminal. Sign in with your ChatGPT account, then select Refresh."
          }
        }
