        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Generate answers when needed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自动回答开启时，识别到问题后会生成参考回答；只记录模式下可手动提问。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With auto-answer enabled, a reference answer is generated when a question is recognized. In Record only mode, you can ask manually."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理会议知识": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Organize meeting knowledge"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按系列管理资料与经验，会后回看转写并生成结构化纪要。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Organize materials and lessons by series, then review the transcript and create structured notes after the meeting."
          }
