    "连接回答服务": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect an answer service"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可使用已登录的 Codex，或填写兼容 API 服务。生成会中参考回答、资料问答和会后纪要时会使用所选服务的网络与额度。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use your signed-in Codex account or configure a compatible API service. The selected service and its usage limits apply to live reference answers, material Q&A, and meeting notes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "尚未连接，生成参考回答和纪要前需要完成": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not connected. Connect a service to generate reference answers and meeting notes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "语音和回答服务准备好后，可按需增强资料检索。系统识别和关键词查找无需额外下载；其他资料功能也可稍后启用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After audio and answer services are ready, you can add richer material search. System recognition and keyword search need no extra downloads; other material features can be enabled later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "设置会议声音": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set up meeting audio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "实时语音是核心功能。需要音频权限和一个可用的识别引擎；推荐本机识别，会议音频留在这台 Mac。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Real-time transcription is a core feature. It needs audio access and an available recognition engine. On-device recognition keeps meeting audio on this Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开会议软件并选择其窗口，或选择麦克风。开始后会实时转写对话；自动回答开启时，识别到问题后会生成参考回答。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Select the meeting window or a microphone. NextThought transcribes the conversation in real time and generates reference answers for recognized questions when auto-answer is enabled."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开始一场会议：选择声音来源并开始记录。开启自动回答后，系统会在识别到问题时生成参考回答；只记录模式仍可输入问题或按快捷键手动请求。回答可在主窗口或回答浮窗查看，会后可回看转写并整理纪要。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To record a meeting, select an audio source and start recording. With auto-answer enabled, recognized questions receive reference answers. In Record only mode, enter a question or use the shortcut to request an answer. View answers in the main window or answer window, then review the transcript and notes afterward."
          }
        }
      }
    },
