        }
      }
    },
    "文字纪要始终保留，格式是多出来的一种看法。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Text notes are always kept; a format is one more way to read the same meeting."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "讲座 / 课程默认用要点大纲，组会用因果鱼骨图，小组讨论用观点对照，其余只有文字纪要。每个节点带原话的时间点，点一下回到转写；没有原话依据的节点会被去掉。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lectures / classes use the outline by default, lab meetings the cause-and-effect fishbone, group discussions the viewpoint matrix; the rest keep only the text notes. Every node carries the time it was said, so one click jumps back to the transcript; nodes with no words behind them are dropped."
          }
        }
      }
    },
