    "默认在这台 Mac 上识别声音，不保存录音。先看一场示例，再决定要不要设置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speech is recognized on this Mac by default, and no recording is kept. See a sample first, then decide whether to set anything up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一场会议，这样被记下来": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is how a meeting gets written down"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "对话是预先写好的：没有录音，不需要任何权限，也不调用模型。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The conversation is scripted: no recording, no permissions, no model calls."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "新手引导上线后，第一天留存 41%，比上一版高 6 个点": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
