    "允许听到会议的声音": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow hearing the meeting"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "声音只在这台 Mac 上识别，不保存录音。需要哪项权限，才在这里问哪项。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speech is recognized on this Mac and no recording is kept. Each permission is asked for only when it is needed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统音频": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "System audio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用来听到电脑里播放的会议声音": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Used to hear the meeting audio playing on this computer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS 把它叫“屏幕与系统音频录制”。允许后，系统可能要求重新打开应用，引导会保留进度。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS calls it “Screen & System Audio Recording”. After you allow it, the system may ask you to reopen the app; the guide keeps your progress."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "暂时不允许也没关系：看示例、整理资料、改设置都不受影响。线下会议只需要麦克风。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It is fine to wait: the sample, organizing materials and settings all work without it. In-person meetings only need the microphone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已允许 · 你说的话会标为“我”": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allowed · what you say is marked as “Me”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已允许 · 麦克风已准备好记录现场声音": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allowed · the microphone is ready to capture the room"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "现在不用允许。第一次开始记录时才会询问，用来标出“我”说的话。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No need to allow it now. You are asked the first time you start recording, to mark what you say as “Me”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未允许 · 只能记录对方的声音。需要时到系统设置里打开。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not allowed · only the other side can be recorded. Turn it on in System Settings when needed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "需要下载本机识别模型，约 %lld MB，只需一次。下载时可以先看后面的步骤。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The on-device speech model needs a download of about %lld MB, once only. You can look at the next steps while it downloads."
