    "系统识别 · 需 macOS 26": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "System · needs macOS 26"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "云端识别 · 需 API Key": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cloud · needs an API key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机模型需要下载并占内存；系统语音受系统版本与语言限制；云端识别会上传会议音频并使用服务额度。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The on-device model needs a download and memory; system speech depends on the OS version and language; cloud recognition uploads meeting audio and uses service quota."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "接上一个回答服务": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect an answer service"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会中的参考回答、会后的纪要，都由它来写。选一个服务商，粘贴 Key，点一下检查。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It writes the suggested answers in a meeting and the notes afterwards. Pick a provider, paste a key, and check it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先不接也可以继续看完引导；开始记录前需要接上。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can finish the guide without connecting; it is needed before you start recording."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有资料，就放进来": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bring your materials"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "议程、简历、产品文档都可以。会前读一遍，会中的回答才贴合这场会议。可以跳过。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An agenda, a résumé, a product doc. Read beforehand, they make answers fit this meeting. You can skip this."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "资料用系统识别和关键词查找，不需要额外下载。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Materials use system recognition and keyword search; nothing extra to download."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用系统识别和关键词查找，不额外下载": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use system recognition and keyword search, no extra download"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "之后在“准备”页把文件拖进来，或到资料夹添加。增强识别可以在设置 → 资料里按需安装。": {
      "localizations": {
