    "今天先看检索实验。上周加入重排之后，结果怎么样？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Let’s start with the retrieval experiment. How did adding reranking last week affect the results?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这组验证集上，Recall@10 从 72% 到了 78%，但候选数量也同时增加了。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On this validation set, Recall@10 rose from 72% to 78%, but we also increased the number of candidates."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "那提升来自重排，还是更多候选？需要怎样的对照才能判断？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Did reranking or more candidates cause the improvement? What comparison would tell us?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "现在还不能确定。我会固定候选数量，再做一组去掉重排的消融。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We cannot tell yet. I’ll hold the candidate count fixed and run an ablation without reranking."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "好，还要记录延迟分布。平均值可能会掩盖长尾，别只报一个数字。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Good. Record the latency distribution too. An average can hide the long tail, so don’t report just one number."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我周五前补齐消融和 P95 延迟，下次组会带上失败样例。": {
