      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NextThought teleprompter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此选项仅在 NextThought 处于前台时提升工作台、设置和分离模块；切换到其他 App 后它们会降回普通层级。回答浮窗保持独立浮窗行为。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The workspace, settings and detached modules float while NextThought is active. They return to the normal level when you switch apps. The answer window remains an independent floating window."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会使用此 Mac 上绑定的本机签名身份，重新签名后重启应用。重启后请再允许一次录屏与麦克风，之后更新会继续使用该身份。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app will use this Mac’s bound local signing identity, then reopen. Allow screen recording and microphone access once more; future updates will continue using that identity."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开 NextThought 手机 App，选择“扫描二维码”。": {
      "localizations": {
