      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stable local signature"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请允许当前 NextThought 访问录屏与系统音频。绑定本机签名后，以后更新不必重新授权。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
