            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No window is available to capture. Confirm macOS allows screen recording for NextThought, then open the page you want to analyze."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NextThought 是一款原生 macOS 应用，可实时转写会议、整理系列资料、识别问题并生成参考回答，也能在会后整理纪要。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NextThought is a native macOS app for transcribing meetings, organizing series materials, recognizing questions, generating reference answers, and preparing meeting notes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
