    "结束预览": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "End preview"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "预览提词岛": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Preview cue island"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不开会时，鼠标停在刘海上可以直接开始一场": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Outside meetings, rest the pointer on the notch to start one"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "提词岛不抢键盘焦点；鼠标停在上面才会展开会议控制和按钮，其余时候点击会穿过它。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The cue island never takes keyboard focus. Meeting controls open only while the pointer rests on it; otherwise clicks pass through."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会中轻提示：语速、说得太久、发言占比": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gentle in-meeting nudges: pace, long stretches, share of talking"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "留意眼神是否离开镜头（使用摄像头）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notice when your eyes leave the camera (uses the camera)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "摄像头权限": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Camera access"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "当前": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Now"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "灵敏度": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sensitivity"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "校准：看着摄像头 2 秒": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calibrate: look at the camera for 2 seconds"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在校准，请看着摄像头…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calibrating. Look at the camera…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已校准": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calibrated"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没有看清眼睛，请正对摄像头再试一次": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't see your eyes. Face the camera and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已校准过": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Already calibrated"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "画面只在这台 Mac 上分析成几个特征点，不保存、不上传。提词岛就在摄像头下方，读提词时视线偏移很小，对方看到的是你在看镜头。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The picture is reduced to a few landmarks on this Mac only. Nothing is saved or uploaded. The cue island sits right under the camera, so reading from it barely moves your gaze, and the other side sees you looking at them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会议软件共享提词岛所在的屏幕时，自动收回刘海": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Withdraw into the notch when a meeting app shares the island's screen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "共享某个窗口或另一块屏幕时，提词岛不在画面里。共享它所在的整块屏幕时，macOS 15.4 起系统不再让应用把自己排除在外，所以提词岛会在识别到 Zoom、Teams、腾讯会议、飞书、钉钉或 Webex 的整屏共享后自动收起；其他软件请先用下面的测试看一眼。%@ 可随时隐藏全部窗口。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The cue island is not in the picture when you share a window or another screen. Since macOS 15.4 an app can no longer exclude itself when its whole screen is shared, so the island withdraws when it detects a full-screen share from Zoom, Teams, Tencent Meeting, Feishu, DingTalk or Webex. For other apps, check with the test below first. %@ hides all windows at any time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已允许": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allowed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "等待允许": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waiting for permission"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未允许，请在系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 摄像头 中打开": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not allowed. Turn it on in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Camera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在看镜头": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Looking at the camera"
          }
        }
