    "没有检测到人脸": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No face detected"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "备份包含项目资料、经验积累、会议记录、个人笔记、模板和设置。先预览再恢复；项目按修改时间合并，记录与模板冲突由你选择。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A backup includes series materials, accumulated lessons, meeting records, personal notes, templates and settings. Preview before restoring. Series merge by modification time, and you choose how to resolve record and template conflicts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
