      }
    },
    "适合扫描件、表格和公式，在本机计算，占一些内存。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suited to scans, tables and formulas. Runs on this Mac and uses some memory."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "读取原文件，不用下载识别模型。需要已登录的 Codex，占用账号额度。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
