          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both methods put only the relevant excerpts into an answer. Your full materials aren't sent by default."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭后，识别失败会让该文件导入失败；不会自动切到在线 Codex。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When this is off, a recognition failure fails that file's import. It doesn't switch to online Codex automatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "扫描并校验本机已有的兼容文档模型与支持组件后复用，保留原文件；不会自动启用识别或语义检索。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scans this Mac for compatible document models and components, verifies them and reuses them. Original files are kept; recognition and semantic search are not turned on automatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "外置磁盘或未找到的目录可手动选择。只有版本与文件校验匹配的模型才能复用。": {
      "localizations": {
