          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn on screen reading above first, so it can tell which slide you are on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "边听你说，勾掉回答里已经讲过的句子，提示下一句；按你说的话和每句回答的文字重合度判断。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
