    "NextThought 按场合帮你开会": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NextThought works the way your meeting does"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先选一个最常用的场合。每个场合有自己的提示和纪要，开会前随时可以换。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
