      }
    },
    "让它听得到": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Let it hear"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只在这里问一次。每一项都要你按下按钮才会请求，不允许也可以先往下看。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It asks once, here. Nothing is requested until you press a button, and you can read on without allowing anything."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会议在哪里": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Where is the meeting"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "线下：只用麦克风，声音标为“现场”。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In person: uses only the microphone, and speech is labeled “Room”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "线上：听电脑里会议软件播放的声音。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Online: listens to the audio your meeting app plays on this computer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已允许 · 能听到会议里对方的声音。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allowed · can hear the other side of the meeting."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用来听到对方的声音。macOS 把它叫“屏幕与系统音频录制”，只取声音，不保存画面。允许后系统可能要求重新打开应用，进度会保留。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Used to hear the other side. macOS calls it “Screen & System Audio Recording”; only the sound is taken and no picture is saved. After you allow it, macOS may ask you to reopen the app. Your progress is kept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "允许系统音频": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow system audio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不使用麦克风，也不会询问权限。会议里只记录对方的声音。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The microphone isn't used and won't ask for access. Only the other side is recorded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "线下会议靠它听现场的声音。点“允许”时系统会询问一次。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In-person meetings use it to hear the room. macOS asks once when you click Allow."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用来标出你自己说的话。点“允许”时系统会询问一次。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Used to mark what you say yourself. macOS asks once when you click Allow."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已允许 · 现场的声音会标为“现场”。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allowed · speech in the room is labeled “Room”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已允许 · 你说的话会标为“我”。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allowed · what you say is labeled “Me”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未允许 · 线下记录需要它，请在系统设置里打开。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not allowed · in-person recording needs it. Turn it on in System Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未允许 · 请在系统设置里打开，或选“只记录对方”。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not allowed · turn it on in System Settings, or choose “Other side only”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "记录我的声音": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Record my voice"
          }
        }
