    "系统语音识别已就绪。声音由系统处理，应用不保存录音。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "System speech recognition is ready. macOS processes the audio and the app keeps no recording."
          }
