      }
    },
    "系统语音识别需要 macOS 26，并明确选择一种语言。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "System speech recognition needs macOS 26 and a language chosen explicitly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "云端识别已配置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cloud recognition is set up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "云端识别需要填写 API Key 并确认音频上传说明。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cloud recognition needs an API key and your confirmation of the audio upload notice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在下载本机识别模型，下载时可以先看后面的步骤。": {
      "localizations": {
