    "下载已取消。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download canceled."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会中的回答和会后的纪要由它来写。选一个服务商，粘贴 Key，点一下检查。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It writes the answers during a meeting and the notes afterwards. Choose a provider, paste a key and click Check."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不连接也能记录和转写；回答和会后纪要需要它，可以之后再接。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recording and transcription work without it. Answers and notes need it, and you can connect it later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会中，回答在镜头下方": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In a meeting, answers sit below the camera"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "第一场按“%@”开始。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your first meeting starts as “%@”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "被问到时，回答出现在摄像头下方的提词岛，眼睛不用离开镜头。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you're asked something, the answer appears on the cue island below the camera, so your eyes stay on the lens."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鼠标停在刘海上，可以暂停、结束或立即回答。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rest the pointer on the notch to pause, end or answer now."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "回到声音": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Back to audio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "回到声音这一步": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Go back to the audio step"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我负责订单服务的缓存层。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I own the caching layer of the order service."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "规模：日均 2 亿次读取，P99 降到 18 ms": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scale: 200 million reads a day, P99 down to 18 ms"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我的角色：方案设计和灰度上线由我主导": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "My role: I led the design and the staged rollout"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "提词岛示意：摄像头下方的黑色浮层，第一行是回答的要点，下面两条是接着要说的内容。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cue island illustration: a black overlay below the camera. The first line is the key point of the answer; the two lines under it are what to say next."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "面试示例": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sample interview"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先聊聊你简历里的检索项目。上周加入重排之后，结果怎么样？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Let's talk about the retrieval project on your resume. How did the results look after you added reranking last week?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "好，还要看延迟分布。平均值可能会掩盖长尾，别只报一个数字。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Okay, we also need the latency distribution. An average can hide the long tail, so don't report just one number."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "我会同时报告 P95 延迟，并把失败样例一起整理出来。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'll report P95 latency as well and collect the failure cases."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "最后一个问题：结论换一组数据还成立吗？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last question: does the conclusion still hold on a different dataset?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已答：Recall@10 从 72% 到 78%，候选数同时变化": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Answered: Recall@10 rose from 72% to 78%, with the candidate count changing too"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "追问：提升来自重排，还是更多候选？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Follow-up: was the gain from reranking or from more candidates?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "复盘：固定候选数，补充去掉重排的消融": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Review: fix the candidate count and add an ablation without reranking"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "追问：报告延迟分布，关注长尾": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Follow-up: report the latency distribution and watch the long tail"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "复盘：补充 P95 延迟与失败样例": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Review: add P95 latency and failure cases"
          }
        }
      }
