      }
    },
    "这场只记录对方的声音。想连自己的话一起记，可以重新打开麦克风。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This meeting records only the other side. To record your own speech too, turn the microphone back on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重新打开麦克风": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn the microphone back on"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只记录对方（不用麦克风）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Other side only (no microphone)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这场不识别你说的话，只记录电脑里播放的声音。以后可以在这里或 设置 → 高级 → 声音与识别 重新打开麦克风。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This meeting doesn't transcribe what you say; it records only the sound your computer plays. You can turn the microphone back on here or in Settings → Advanced → Sound and recognition."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以后可在设置 → 高级 → 声音与识别 重新打开": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can turn it back on later in Settings → Advanced → Sound and recognition"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不用麦克风，只记录电脑里播放的声音。以后可在设置 → 高级 → 声音与识别 重新打开。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No microphone; only the sound your computer plays is recorded. You can turn it back on later in Settings → Advanced → Sound and recognition."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从这个资料夹开始一场会议，记录和资料会保存在一起。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start a meeting from this Library folder. Its records and materials are kept together."
          }
        }
      }
