    "系统声音": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "System audio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在下载 · ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloading · "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机模型已就绪": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On-device model ready"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "需要下载（约 %lld MB）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download needed (about %lld MB)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "需要下载": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download needed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple 语音识别（本机）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple speech recognition (on this Mac)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "云端识别 · ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cloud recognition · "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全部设置…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All settings…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这里的选项一般不需要改。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You rarely need to change anything here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认声音来源": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Default audio source"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "准备页里每场会议可以单独选；这里是没有准备页时用的来源。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each meeting can pick its own source on the prepare page. This is the source used when there is no prepare page."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重新读取窗口列表": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reload the window list"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "刷新窗口列表": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Refresh the window list"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把声音变成文字的方式。推荐本地离线：不上传声音，也不用 Key。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How speech becomes text. On-device offline is recommended: no audio is uploaded and no key is needed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "临时专业词": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Temporary terms"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "专业词 / 人名，逗号分隔": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Terms / names, comma separated"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "随手填的人名、项目名，只用来提高识别准确度；长期的词表在 通用 → 术语和人名。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Names and project names you jot down here only improve recognition accuracy. Your long-term word list is in General → Terms and names."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "边说边出字的识别模型。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The model that shows text as you speak."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整句精修": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sentence refinement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每句说完后，再用更准的离线模型把整句重新识别一遍（推荐）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After each sentence, a more accurate offline model recognizes it again (recommended)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "后台预加载识别模型": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Preload the recognition model in the background"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "提前把模型放进内存，开始记录几乎瞬间启动，会多占一些内存。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keeps the model in memory so recording starts almost instantly. Uses some extra memory."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "忽略扬声器回声（推荐）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ignore speaker echo (recommended)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不戴耳机时对方的声音会从扬声器传进麦克风；应用比对两路音频，回声不记为“我”。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Without headphones, the other side's voice comes out of the speakers and into the microphone. The app compares the two audio paths, and echo isn't recorded as “Me”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "交给系统在录音时消除回声；少数设备上可能让声音变小。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lets macOS cancel echo while recording. On a few devices it can make the sound quieter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "推理强度与预设": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reasoning effort and presets"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "推理强度越高，回答越慢也越用心；预设是保存好的服务商设置，可以来回切换。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Higher reasoning effort gives slower, more careful answers. A preset is a saved provider setup you can switch between."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不确定的句子交给回答服务二次判断": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Let the answer service double-check uncertain sentences"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机规则先逐句判断是不是在向你提问；拿不准的句子再让回答服务确认一次，更准，但会多用一点额度。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On-device rules first judge each sentence for whether it's a question to you. Sentences they can't decide go to the answer service for a second look. More accurate, but it uses a little more quota."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "需要使用 API 回答服务才能启用二次判断。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The second check needs an API answer service."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "常驻服务让 Codex 一直开着，回答逐字流式出现，也更快；不可用时自动改用 codex exec，它每次新开一个进程，等完整结果后才显示。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The resident service keeps Codex running, so answers stream in word by word and arrive sooner. When it isn't available, the app falls back to codex exec, which starts a new process each time and shows the answer only when it is complete."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存转录和会中回答，不保存原始音频。生成纪要时会把本次转录发送给当前回答服务。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saves the transcript and in-meeting answers, never the raw audio. When notes are written, this meeting's transcript is sent to the current answer service."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入会合并，不删除现有数据；先预览，再决定恢复什么。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Importing merges and never deletes existing data. Preview first, then decide what to restore."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " 最近备份：": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " Last backup: "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "权限": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permissions"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未允许 · 听会议声音和读屏幕都需要它": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not allowed · needed to hear meeting audio and read the screen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "第一次使用时才会询问": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asked the first time it is used"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "摄像头": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Camera"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已允许 · 临场教练用它留意眼神，画面不保存、不上传": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allowed · the live coach uses it to watch eye contact. Video is neither saved nor uploaded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开“留意眼神”时才会询问": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Asked only when you turn on “Watch eye contact”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未允许 · 只影响临场教练的眼神提示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not allowed · affects only the live coach's eye-contact hints"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在访达中显示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show in Finder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "恢复点最多保留最近 10 份、软预算 2 GiB，不含模型、索引或密钥。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restore points keep the latest 10 within a soft 2 GiB budget. They don't include models, indexes or keys."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导出时包含 API Key 与访问令牌": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Include API keys and access tokens when exporting"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入时同时导入设置（回答服务、识别、快捷键等）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Also import settings (answer service, recognition, shortcuts and so on)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "数据保存在 %@。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Data is stored in %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "检查回答服务、选择模型、准备语音识别、刷新音频来源并重建资料索引。缺少本地语音模型时会在后台下载，不影响使用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checks the answer service, picks a model, prepares speech recognition, refreshes audio sources and rebuilds the materials index. A missing on-device speech model downloads in the background and doesn't block use."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一键配置会检查并配好回答服务、语音模型、音频来源和资料索引；哪一步没成功会直接写在下面。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One-click setup checks and configures the answer service, speech model, audio sources and materials index. Any step that fails is listed below."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "减少视觉特效": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reduce visual effects"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭实时折射，改用平面半透明效果，更流畅、更省电。系统“降低透明度”开启时会自动使用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turns off live refraction in favor of a flat translucent look: smoother and lighter on battery. Used automatically when macOS Reduce Transparency is on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "工作台置顶": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep the workspace on top"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只在 NextThought 处于前台时生效；切换到其他 App 后会降回普通层级。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Applies only while NextThought is in front. It drops to a normal window level when you switch to another app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "各场景开会时的设置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Settings for each scene"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开始一场会时按这里的设置来；会中仍可随时切换。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A meeting starts with these settings. You can still switch during the meeting."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "恢复默认": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reset to default"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会中": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In meeting"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "简洁": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Brief"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "纪要模板": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notes template"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "显示提词浮窗": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show the floating window"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每个场景用要点还是逐句，在“场景”页设置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Whether each scene uses key points or full sentences is set on the Scenes page."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "摄像头还没有允许。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Camera access isn't allowed yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "画面只在这台 Mac 上分析，不保存、不上传。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Video is analyzed on this Mac only and is neither saved nor uploaded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "共享整块屏幕时，系统不再让应用把自己排除在外，提词岛只能靠自动收回；其他软件先点测试看一眼。%@ 可随时隐藏全部窗口。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you share an entire screen, macOS no longer lets an app exclude itself, so the cue island can only withdraw on its own. Run the test first if you use other software. %@ hides all windows at any time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "快捷键…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shortcuts…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已展开": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Expanded"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已折叠": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Collapsed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "提词岛不抢键盘焦点；鼠标停在上面才会展开按钮。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The cue island never takes keyboard focus. Buttons open only while the pointer rests on it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "提词浮窗": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
