    "总是": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Always"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "需要最新信息时，先给出快速回答，再在后台联网，几秒后换成联网版。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When a question needs current information, you get a fast answer first. It searches the web in the background and swaps in the web version a few seconds later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这种搜索方式需要 Codex 并用 ChatGPT 账号登录。只用 API Key 时，请把“搜索方式”改成 Tavily。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This search method needs Codex signed in with a ChatGPT account. If you only use an API key, switch “Search method” to Tavily."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "问题文本会发送给 Tavily；它返回的网页摘要由当前回答服务整理，并在回答中标注来源。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The question text is sent to Tavily. The page summaries it returns are organized by the current answer service, and the answer cites its sources."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "发一句测试问题，确认回答服务能正常回答": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send a test question to confirm the answer service responds"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "还没有系列使用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not used by any series yet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 个系列在用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Used by %lld series"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "启动后及每 6 小时检查；有新版本时在后台下载。更新前会自动备份，并校验安装包。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checks at launch and every 6 hours, and downloads new versions in the background. A backup is made before updating and the package is verified."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "新版本的签名与当前不同，安装后系统会要求重新允许录屏与麦克风。可在 设置 → 高级 → 数据与维护 中“绑定本机签名”避免以后再出现。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The new version is signed differently from this one, so macOS will ask you to allow screen recording and the microphone again after installing. Bind the local signature in Settings → Advanced → Data and maintenance to avoid this in future."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "联网搜索还没设置：在 设置 → 回答与资料 → 联网搜索 打开联网，并在 设置 → 高级 → 回答服务 选择 Codex 或填写 Tavily Key。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Web search isn't set up. Turn it on in Settings → Answers and materials → Web search, then choose Codex or enter a Tavily key in Settings → Advanced → Answer service."
          }
        }
      }
